{"unit_id":"CHIP-PHILO-GH__dsh-session-namer#card-zh","repo":"CHIP-PHILO-GH/dsh-session-namer","commit":"6453aa58327e5589ab1ee9b0e47952d77b86ecc6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-namer 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话命名插件，在用户创建新会话时先打开命名对话框，再按输入创建会话。它接管 uiWorkspace 的 startSession 与 openWorkspace，并通过 shell.overlay 显示界面、通过会话绑定提交标题。用户可以预览标题、看到字节数提示；留空时保留首条消息自动命名，取消时不创建会话，过长标题按 UTF-8 字节上限截断。适合希望在开始工作时给会话指定清晰名称的 Web 用户。插件使用宿主提供的 React、界面原语及会话服务，无额外 API 密钥或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:312-331","lib/client.js:374-429","lib/client.js:459-498","lib/client.js:204-213"]}
{"unit_id":"CHIP-PHILO-GH__dsh-session-namer#card-en","repo":"CHIP-PHILO-GH/dsh-session-namer","commit":"6453aa58327e5589ab1ee9b0e47952d77b86ecc6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-namer adds a title dialog before new sessions in DSH web. It wraps uiWorkspace and applies the chosen title through the session binding. Users can preview a title, leave it blank for automatic naming, or cancel. Long titles are truncated by UTF-8 byte length; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:312-331","lib/client.js:374-429","lib/client.js:459-498","lib/client.js:204-213"]}
