{"unit_id":"CHIP-PHILO-GH__dsh-session-namer#feature-1","repo":"CHIP-PHILO-GH/dsh-session-namer","commit":"6453aa58327e5589ab1ee9b0e47952d77b86ecc6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-namer 的功能「创建前命名」：点击新建会话后先出现命名对话框，确认后才调用原有会话创建流程。输入内容用于新会话标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:386-388","lib/client.js:400-409"]}
